		<link>https://www.nasa.gov/blogs/spacestation/2026/10/01/crew-13-members-enter-station-join-expedition-75/</link>

		<pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 02:01:55 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nasa.gov/?post_type=nasa-blog&amp;p=1052022</guid>

					<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p class="wp-block-paragraph">NASA astronauts <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nasa.gov%2Fpeople%2Fjessica-watkins%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmark.a.garcia%40nasa.gov%7Cf44dbfc996674a2c35e608df2028903d%7C7005d45845be48ae8140d43da96dd17b%7C0%7C0%7C639265030753551743%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=36xH%2FJRGdZEHnYaJXyZqq%2F91dCx3Z0m1Og8jddG2IeE%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Jessica Watkins</a> and <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nasa.gov%2Fpeople%2Fnasa-astronaut-luke-delaney%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmark.a.garcia%40nasa.gov%7Cf44dbfc996674a2c35e608df2028903d%7C7005d45845be48ae8140d43da96dd17b%7C0%7C0%7C639265030753578548%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=m3%2B9dAgKNNC%2BD9WAoLoU0eg7PcNu476DENg9BUnLJCE%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Luke Delaney</a>, CSA (Canadian Space Agency) astronaut Joshua Kutryk, and Roscosmos cosmonaut Sergey Teteryatnikov have entered the International Space Station following Dragon’s hatch opening at 9:19 p.m. EDT.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Crew-13 now joins Expedition 75 crew, which includes NASA astronauts <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nasa.gov%2Fpeople%2Fjessica-u-meir%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmark.a.garcia%40nasa.gov%7Cf44dbfc996674a2c35e608df2028903d%7C7005d45845be48ae8140d43da96dd17b%7C0%7C0%7C639265030753597332%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=s6sIH%2FavZA77B%2BrKPuYPt06I18%2FF2vg1xJ2Zj58UcB8%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Jessica Meir</a>, <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nasa.gov%2Fpeople%2Fnasa-astronaut-jack-hathaway%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmark.a.garcia%40nasa.gov%7Cf44dbfc996674a2c35e608df2028903d%7C7005d45845be48ae8140d43da96dd17b%7C0%7C0%7C639265030753615944%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=aOExA%2Fwl2WkSgJJjOTFQ0zdkuiM6Ih%2BYnmyUmcvUiYs%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Jack Hathaway</a>, and <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nasa.gov%2Fpeople%2Fnasa-astronaut-anil-menon%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmark.a.garcia%40nasa.gov%7Cf44dbfc996674a2c35e608df2028903d%7C7005d45845be48ae8140d43da96dd17b%7C0%7C0%7C639265030753636017%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=PpSXsFTllk%2FHJdaFN8psWB6YyN0z7Mbkt%2BhMugxuHMw%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Anil Menon</a>, ESA (European Space Agency) astronaut Sophie Adenot, and Roscosmos cosmonauts Pyotr Dubrov, Anna Kikina, and Andrey Fedyaev already aboard the orbiting laboratory.&nbsp;</p>
